====== MikroTik RouterBOARD RB450Gx4 ======

/* This template is intended to be used via https://openwrt.org/meta/create_new_device_page . */

{{page>meta:infobox:construction&noheader&nofooter&noeditbtn}}

The RB450Gx4 is an Ethernet router with five Gigabit Ethernet ports, a serial port, 512 MB NAND memory and a microSD card slot. In addition, it supports full 10 V - 57 V input by two power jacks or PoE (802.3af/ at or passive PoE) and can provide PoE output for Ethernet port #5. The device is powered by a quad core ARM CPU, has 1 GB of RAM and supports hardware IPsec encryption.

