===== Experimental firmware =====

  * Heavy work in progress, however everything is functional, including SD card support.  
  * Native support for RouterBOOT bootloader (via an auxiliary loader). 
  * Prebuilt images from the experimental branch are available (LuCI included) [[https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1iIm3bo-08U8u-QfliMTf-ULeyyk57x_b
|here]].
  * If you need to build your own image with kernel dependencies, use the **RB450Gx4-rebase-sdhci** branch available at [[https://github.com/robimarko/openwrt.git]] along with with proper [[https://forum.openwrt.org/t/mikrotik-rb450gx4-support/20427/102|package snapshots]] from the time of the rebase.


==== Installation instructions ====

